### Command::Config ###
Each <Command> here configures one chat command. Index is fixed by the
engine (it drives the internal dispatch table) - do not renumber existing
entries or reuse an Index for a different command.
  Index          Command id. Do not change for existing commands.
  Names          Comma-separated list of chat strings that trigger this
                 command, without the leading "/" (e.g. "addstr,s,str,f"
                 - all four run the same command with the same
                 permissions/cooldown; the loader adds "/" back
                 automatically). The first name is the canonical one.
  Delay          Cooldown in seconds before the command can be used
                 again (shared across all VIP tiers).
  GameMaster     Minimum GM level required: 0 = normal player,
                 1 = Game Master, 2 = Administrator.
  Coin1/2/3      WCoinC / WCoinP / GoblinPoint cost per use.
  Enable_ALn     1 = allowed, 0 = disabled, for VIP tier n (0-3).
  Money_ALn      Zen cost per use, for VIP tier n.
  MinLevel_ALn   Minimum character level required, for VIP tier n.
  MaxLevel_ALn   Maximum character level allowed, for VIP tier n
                 (0 = no cap).
  MinReset_ALn   Minimum Reset count required, for VIP tier n.
  MaxReset_ALn   Maximum Reset count allowed, for VIP tier n
                 (0 = no cap).
  Comment        Free-text description, for readability only (not read
                 by the loader).

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

